{"server":"cn","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_st01","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_st01","title":"前奏“意外归来”","storyCode":"ZT-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"89e966f900651af17916f655f4a186f678322421abb3687dfcf2780832ff09cc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"女皇庆典在即，施彤领选帝侯沃尔纳·冯·霍赫贝格在自己的高塔中遇刺。薇薇安娜回到阔别已久的家乡，结识了父母故友珂拉，却错过了见父亲沃尔纳的最后一面。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g9_auditorium"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"施彤领大区的夜晚往往风雨交加。家族世代相传的高塔又太过古老，无论术师们怎么努力，都无法清除掉台阶缝隙里的每一处青苔。\n他想起崔林特尔梅。彼时旋角状的黑色高塔还未被新生的双塔取代，那座雄伟的城市还是另一个名字。\n秋天的小巷总是金灿灿的，年轻的他穿行其中，怀中没有法杖与匕首，只有几本诗集，以及对自由的希冀。\n不像现在。即便风暴暂时停下了，塔的最高处还是冷得厉害。雨一样的月光穿透帷幔，将所有的期盼钉死在原地。\n太可惜了，他心想。\n他永远看不到金盏花再一次盛放。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"1100年，莱塔尼亚北部边境，施彤领大区首府费尔斯"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精彩，太精彩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么流畅的演奏，就像月光轻抚我的脸颊——埃里希阁下，您怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛尔塔小姐，您为何要这般对待我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃里希阁下，您的前未婚妻并不在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您冷酷的脸庞深深刺痛了我的心脏，可您的美貌又夺走了我的呼吸，令我无法忘怀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建议您把手从我腰上移开，已经有人在看我们了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉！这首曲子结束了吗？我竟然没有发觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道为什么，刚刚我仿佛又回到了去年秋天，那个玛尔塔离我而去的日子。悲伤令我喘不过气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还是该多出去散散心。像这样的音乐会，在施彤领可能不太多见，到了崔林特尔梅就不一样啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我恐怕去不成今年的女皇庆典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得阁下的一位远房叔父在选帝侯宫廷供职。莫非您得到了什么消息？沃尔纳选帝侯他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，并没有什么可靠的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这几个月来，选帝侯几乎没有离开过他的高塔。医生去得越来越少，代表着其他家族的术师反倒越来越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这阵子我们都没法离开施彤领咯。女皇庆典年年都有，但谁又敢错过初次觐见新领主呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不敢这么想。饶了我吧，我宁可多想想我的玛尔塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏有阿尔图罗小姐在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有在她的琴声中，我才能暂时从白天的焦头烂额里走出来，喘口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得是呀。可惜，今天是她在这里的最后一场演奏会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那让我再好好沉醉一会吧，一会就好。毕竟，风暴又快来啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g5_noblehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站在这里做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总管没有交代你该做什么吗？送完晚餐之后，立刻回到地下室去。不要打扰选帝侯休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"侍从对严厉的呵斥置若罔闻。\n她茫然地往前走着。顺着阶梯，向着门外，就像一具失去了魂灵的空壳，茫然地循着外面的雷声行动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手上是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选帝侯他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卫队，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，这天怎么说变就变。再这样下去，刚囤的干柴又要变潮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，火怎么还没点起来？！不过是去一趟后院，怎么花了这么长时间，是不是又忘了拿法杖——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......先生，能不能再多给我一根蜡烛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，德罗斯特女士。您还是和昨天一样，要在这里等人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上风格外地大。您还是上楼去吧，房间里更暖和些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。虽然很久没有回来了......但我的身体依旧习惯这里的风和雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，差点忘了，您也是施彤领出身的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"前些年在报纸上读到关于您的报道，我还挺惊讶的。明明在这附近长大的孩子，我全都该有些印象才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不记得我是正常的。我只是个普通人......一直都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您可太谦虚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"直到看见您踏进我的小店，我才确信，那些报纸上说的也并不都是假的。您确实高贵又优雅，就像从那些高塔上走下来的大贵族一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您这两天的照拂，穆勒先生。尤其是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我不会把您在这里的事说出去的。我知道，就算您已经退役了，媒体还是追着您不放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"往好处想，这里毕竟是莱塔尼亚，只有关于贵族老爷的大事才能上头条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大概吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧我，又自顾自聊了起来，耽误您时间了。蜡烛先给您。还需要什么别的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......您还有没有其他的书可以借给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"之前那本小说您已经读完了？我看看，接下来您想看点什么呢？柜子里还有两本画册，一本历史小说，五六本诗集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不是更喜欢诗集一些？沃尔纳选帝侯经常举办民间诗会，听说这几位诗人都是他的座上宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，请给我那本历史小说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到这里之后，我暂时读不下去任何诗歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那您拿着这本小说，想看多久都没关系。我就不打扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杂货店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，汉克——臭小子，到底去哪里偷懒了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......《余烬》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是一个有些意思的故事。虽然......与真实的历史相去甚远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这里还有其他客人。晚上好，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉。珂拉·洛文斯坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛文斯坦女士，您也读过这本小说吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，我只听过由这本小说改编的歌剧。在它出版的那一年，我已经失去了欣赏文字的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的眼睛......不好意思，我刚刚没发觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十多年啦，早习惯了，而且还能在这种日子里省下一点蜡烛和柴火。介意我坐得更近一些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么温暖的烛火啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面是不是开始下雨了？您的衣服都是湿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"着急赶路，我忘记打伞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我冒昧地猜测一下，您是来找我的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年来，这里的生意一直这么冷清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，应该说......整个施彤领都没怎么变过。远离首都，天灾频发，阴雨连绵。要不是在特殊时期，这个地方很难吸引这么多外人过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，从这个位置旁边的窗户望出去，是能看到选帝侯起居塔所在的移动地块的吧？他该为你选一个更隐蔽的地方的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，是他让您来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"握紧我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人......很多人，躲在外面的风声里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，你能控制手边的烛火吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请准备好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先让它“熄灭”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烛光暗下去的刹那，杂货店的窗户全部裂开了。\n与屋外的风雨一起涌进来的，是效果各异的法术能量。\n薇薇安娜握着珂拉的手，感到自己仿佛坐在惊涛骇浪中心的小舟上。\n一波又一波的源石技艺朝她们倾泻着，几乎将这间小小的店面轰成碎片，可唯独绕过了她们两个。\n有脚步声在屋内响起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们看不清我们在哪，只能走到近处试探。感觉到他们的位置了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很清楚。让我来处理吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烛火在薇薇安娜掌心重新燃起。\n暗影就像被赋予了生命，从废墟中伸出手脚，穿过四周的断壁残垣，将正在靠近的术师们按在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......七个，八个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们暂时安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你解决了最大的麻烦。我只是稍稍给他们施放的源石技艺“调”了一下音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，在更多杀手找上门之前，麻烦帮我离开这里吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那些人是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和我一样，也是来找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穆勒先生，还有汉克，他们会有危险吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好心的老板去后院了，躲过了这一劫。稍后我的同伴会带他转移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于帮工先生......是他把人叫来的。与险恶之人打交道，他该知道自己得到的不会只有几枚源石锭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不认为，自己是什么有价值的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍后我再对你解释。在这之前，薇薇安娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能，让我好好“看一看”你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女子美丽的脸庞虽然陌生，但她的神情与声音都是那般亲切。薇薇安娜发现自己无法拒绝对方的请求。\n珂拉抬起双手，试探着触碰薇薇安娜的脸颊，又轻抚了几下。她的动作无比轻柔，就像对待一件最珍贵的乐器。\n紧跟着，她那双欠缺神采的眼睛里涌起了泪水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你长得很像你的母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沃尔纳也能亲眼见到你，他一定会很欣慰的。明明只差这么一点点......他在病榻上苦苦支撑了那么久，就是为了再见你一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔纳......父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不久以前，你的父亲......施彤领选帝侯沃尔纳，在自己的高塔中离世了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g5_noblehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就这么发生了，阁下。我们都在各自的位置上值守，没人料到会有刺客潜入选帝侯的房间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刺客。你是说，那名选帝侯的贴身侍从？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在这座塔里工作了大半辈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选帝侯很信任她，我们也是。可她的确是最后一个见到选帝侯的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出事之后，还有其他人进过房间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有亲卫和医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有人出去过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，阁下，今天晚上没有人离开起居塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还不知道是哪一环出了差错，所以把佣人们都关在了塔底的黑狱里。需要我为您引路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，我已见过每一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您审问过那名刺客了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受到精神类源石技艺的影响，她并不记得自己的所见所闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该试着拷问她，不然的话，很难断定她是不是在撒谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你在撒谎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？不，阁下，这怎么可能？我从十年前就开始效忠于霍赫贝格家族，我拥有的一切都是沃尔纳选帝侯给的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否......愿意对金律乐章起誓？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金......律......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么敢......欺骗一位金律法卫？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"案发之后，你离开了高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上有雨水的味道。你的衣角还蹭到了塔外台阶缝隙里的青苔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年时间还不够长。你还不够熟悉霍赫贝格家族的高塔，就像你还不够熟悉沃尔纳选帝侯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选帝侯他......把你们叫来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选帝侯察觉到了你们的异心。自他病后，你们就开始蠢蠢欲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜我和洛文斯坦女士还是来晚了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高塔术师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g12_sewer"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得传信给“首席”，金律法卫已经发现——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必妄想挣脱旋律的束缚。你的源石技艺，就如同你的心智一样，丑陋且脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们把那样东西送去了哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，余孽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崔......崔林特尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所说的“首席”，是那个使用精神类源石技艺影响侍从的人吗？此人也在崔林特尔梅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首席......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我的头......好疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黄金旋律在你的灵魂深处奏响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何违抗的意图，都会令你的心灵与头脑无法承受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律法卫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拥有这样无法违抗的力量，为何非要充当那对双子傀儡的奴仆？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"约束着你的并非我的旋律，也不是女皇的旨意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你无法对抗莱塔尼亚的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚......的意志？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈！谁说如今的莱塔尼亚......还拥有本该有的意志？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“始源之角”......赫尔昏佐伦的力量，终将重新笼罩这片土地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“高塔术师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1135_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡引发的微弱杂音。能远距离捕捉类似鸣响的术师，绝非寻常残党。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“首席”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贵族侍从","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，去崔林特尔梅的车到了。要现在就走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，上路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀请我的朋友刚刚谢幕，该奏的曲子皆已奏完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有必要再留在此地了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g11_lounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知不觉就......待到了现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛尔塔，我的玛尔塔......唉，就跟做了一场梦一般，也不知道下次再听到这么出色的演奏是什么时候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是都跟你们说了吗，在我听音乐会的时候，不要打扰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？等等，你再说一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我马上回去，给我备好车，我要去见几个朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，把前几天从鲁珀坎大区买来的木刻饰品，还有书房里那套维多利亚骨瓷都带上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这么突然？早上不还说选帝侯好好的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的日子又要难熬咯。阿尔图罗小姐......啊，只有阿尔图罗小姐的音乐与美貌能将我从噩梦中拯救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花了那么大功夫才要到了她的临时住址，谁知道她会提前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请说下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说、说下去？您是什么人？您手上的是法杖还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你提到了拜访阿尔图罗的意愿。我假定你与她有所关联。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在寻找她，因此需要一切与她有关的线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也想找阿尔图罗小姐？您是她的狂热追随者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追随者？这种说法很不准确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因律法规定与教皇厅特殊任务要求，我必须尽快将该名通缉犯带回拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通、通缉犯？阿尔图罗小姐是选帝侯的客人，就算有外面那些传闻......不，先生，我觉得您才更可疑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃里希阁下！您有没有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的巷子都已经戒严，到处都是宪兵。我听说，还有金律法卫去了选帝侯的起居塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还好，多谢关心。我正准备去拜访几位伯爵来打探下消息呢。唉，这一夜实在太多怪事了。都怪我那偷懒的司机，现在都没到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏阿尔图罗小姐已经出发去崔林特尔梅，至少她是安全的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那个奇怪的萨科塔呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通缉犯阿尔图罗已不在此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行者费德里科，继续追捕目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目的地——莱塔尼亚首都，崔林特尔梅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，我们也该启程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们对外宣称选帝侯是因病身故。为了领地的安定，这个做法可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能去参加葬礼，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉。你从卡西米尔赶回来，却没能见他最后一面，也不能光明正大地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哀悼他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至，不确定自己有没有这个资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我几乎连他的样子都记不起来了。这么多年过去，父亲对我而言，就是那一封封寄到卡西米尔的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我忍不住想，就连信上的文字，也有可能是扈从替他写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的父亲从未有一刻忘记过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......所有人，包括他本人，都是这样告诉我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也愿意相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可当我收到最后那封信的时候，我还是感到了犹豫。我不知道自己该不该......不，想不想回到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有一颗柔软的心，薇薇安娜。你拒绝不了一个垂死之人最后的心愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又或许，我是想再看一眼那座高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想看看它......是不是如同我记忆中那般高耸入云。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能回到那座高塔，至少现在还不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全起见，我们不该在施彤领逗留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谋害他的人，和昨夜那些来找我们的术师......是受相同的人指使吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必。沃尔纳不在了，任何知晓你身份的人，都有可能会对你动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是你父亲唯一的血脉。在这个风雨飘摇的时刻，他的敌人，他曾经的附庸，以及所有可能拥有继承权的人都不会放过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢？您为何要保护我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能还留有一些印象，孩子。十三年前，在你的母亲去世之后，是我将你送到了大骑士领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......莱塔尼亚皇家乐团的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......调音师。一个相当便利的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皇家乐团的出访代表着莱塔尼亚与卡西米尔的友好关系。没人会质疑其中一名捧着乐器的孩子的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您救过我......不止一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正想救你的，是你的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数月前，沃尔纳自知时日无多，他担心自己走后，你会沦为权力斗争的牺牲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身份过于特殊。无论你选择回到莱塔尼亚，还是留在卡西米尔，恐怕都会受到波及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不得不再一次找到了我和布兰特。他希望我们这些老朋友能将你安全地带到崔林特尔梅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，你将会受到女皇的庇护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇......的庇护？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这是沃尔纳的愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜·冯·霍赫贝格——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将代表你的家族，成为一名女皇之声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱塔尼亚中部，恩瓦德大区，崔林特尔梅周边城镇，距入城关口不远处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......好困。该死的，怎么又是我值班？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮年轻的混账，天天早走。今天又是什么借口来着，新上的电影，还是地下酒吧的演唱会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下个月我一定去找男爵说说话，好早点调去崔林特尔梅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么晚了，你在这晃悠什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是寻常走路而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，这里并没有什么新的法令规定，在十二点之后不允许像我这样的平民在荒野上行走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倒是没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过又是个无聊到四处闲逛的年轻人，我何必这么紧张......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我可以离开了吗？感谢您的关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，走......等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么觉得......在哪里见过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指不定是您的错觉。毕竟就像您说的，闲逛的年轻人到处都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从哪里来的？听你的口音，你是乌提卡领来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出生于乌提卡......乡下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乡下？乡下人是这个口音？别逗我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是提醒了我，真没听过平民小孩用你这个腔调说话的。我说，你该不会是哪个小贵族家偷跑出来的少爷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我看一眼你的证件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如您幻想着可以把我送去某处以博得某位贵族的欢心，那您一定会失望的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有没有人说过，你说起话来真的很让人恼火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证件。拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了来了，这是我家小朋友的护照，您过目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，您不记得我了？我不就在城里住嘛，卖旧书的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，书店生意不太好做，最近我还在考虑改卖咖啡。这么晚了还在巡逻，您一定挺累的吧？来来来，尝尝我做的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......呃，这味道还真是......我劝你别想着开咖啡店了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，至少能提神。护照您看好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑键。这是你的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的父母十分喜爱乐器，尤其是钢琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的执勤人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1133_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧走吧，反正护照看着挺真，我何必计较名字的真假？对了，卖书的，把你兜里的刷锅水都给我留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道会回来，你是不是就不会烧掉那本护照了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你们想要我回来的时候，自然会像现在一样，准备第二本......甚至无数本新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你为什么要回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡领的几十万人，高塔里的百余位侍从......我还没有自私到为了所谓的自由牺牲这么多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不必开这种玩笑，亲爱的密探先生。或者，是女皇陛下让您来试探我，看看我是不是发自内心地愿意听候调遣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇庆典临近，最近的崔林特尔梅并不太平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......那东西还在我的脑子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比你们任何人都清楚，这首过于难听的曲子还远远没有结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说，年轻人。我的任务到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去崔林特尔梅之后，会有其他人来接应你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你已经知道，那封......命你回来的密信，与先前赐予你“死亡”的密信，并不是出自同一位陛下之手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比于先前那位的仁慈，这一位......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别格勒的话并没有说完，黑键已经迈开了脚步。\n在背影彻底消失在拐角处之前，青年冲着他摆了摆手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的乌提卡伯爵，你是在期待......一场真正的“死亡”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这灰蒙蒙的坏天气，害得我都多愁善感了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我们这种人，要是真的还留着一些没有用光的运气——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_485_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那就祈祷不必再见吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
